'''Travis Carroll''' (born October 26, 1978) is an American former professional [[American football|football]] player who played as a [[linebacker]] in college for [[Alabama Crimson Tide football|Alabama]] and [[Florida Gators football|Florida]],<ref>{{Cite web |title=Travis Carroll (LB) Stats, News, Rumors, Bio, Video |url=https://sports.yahoo.com/nfl/players/6233/ |access-date=2026-03-11 |website=Yahoo Sports |language=en-US |archive-date=September 15, 2004 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20040915180715/http://sports.yahoo.com/nfl/players/6233 |url-status=live }}</ref> and in the [[National Football League]] (NFL) for the [[New Orleans Saints]] and [[Houston Texans]].<ref>{{Cite web |title=Travis Carroll Biography |url=https://www.espn.com/nfl/player/bio/_/id/4323/travis-carroll |access-date=2026-03-12 |website=ESPN |language=en}}</ref>
